@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "停止\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = false" as Stopped
state "運転中\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = false" as Running
state "運転中・再起動ブロック\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = true" as RunBlocked
state "停止・再起動ブロック\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = true" as StopBlocked

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Running : 正常な START が ON、\n正常な STOP が解放
Stopped --> StopBlocked : いずれかの入力の故障
Running --> Stopped : 正常な STOP が押下
Running --> RunBlocked : START の故障、\n正常な STOP が解放
Running --> StopBlocked : STOP の故障、または START\n故障中に STOP が押下
RunBlocked --> Running : 両方正常、\nSTART が OFF、STOP が解放
RunBlocked --> Stopped : 正常な STOP が押下、\n正常な START が OFF
RunBlocked --> StopBlocked : STOP の故障、または START が\nON か故障中に STOP が押下
StopBlocked --> Stopped : 両方正常、START が OFF
@enduml
